* CABSRT16 - SUSPENSE CONSOLIDATION FOR THE AGEING REPORT
* MERGES FOUR GENERATIONS OF THE SUSPENSE FILE AND REMOVES EXACT
* DUPLICATES.  A RECORD THAT WAS RECYCLED AND SUSPENDED AGAIN
* APPEARS ON TWO GENERATIONS WITH THE SAME CONTENT EXCEPT FOR
* THE RUN ID, SO THE DUPLICATE TEST AS FILED EXCLUDES THE
* RUN ID FIELD.
*
* THAT MEANS THE AGEING REPORT SEES THE OLDEST RUN ID AND THE
* AGE IT REPORTS IS THE AGE OF THE FIRST SUSPENSION, NOT THE
* MOST RECENT ONE.  THAT IS AGREED AND IS WHY THE OLDEST
* ITEM LIST IS WORTH LOOKING AT.
 SORT FIELDS=(1,4,CH,A,6,8,CH,A,14,30,CH,A,56,200,CH,A)
 SUM FIELDS=NONE
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=300
